su name prompt ob text "Recording 10 seconds from the microphone, then transcribing the file with hear." be write do
su name note ob text "Override 'ffmpeg input device' if your OS uses a different device (e.g., pipewire)." be write do
exists su name cmd ob text "ffmpeg -y -f " be text ya
ob name ffmpeg input to name cmd be plus do
ob text " -i " to name cmd be plus do
ob name ffmpeg input device to name cmd be plus do
ob text " -t 10 /tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" to name cmd be plus do
ob text of cmd be command do
su name output from filename "/tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be hear do
ob name output be write do
